  "Blocks": [
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "LinkedIn enables ATS platforms to store and display applicant evaluation data generated by LinkedIn Hiring Assistant (LiHA), helping you, as LinkedIn partners, to streamline the recruitment process. LinkedIn exports these evaluations via a versioned API, where applicable.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "This workflow consists of the following three steps.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "Configure RSC integration for a customer with a webhook callback URL.\nAfter an application is evaluated, LinkedIn sends a webhook event containing a request ID.\nRetrieve the evaluated application data by calling the /exportedApplicationEvaluation API endpoint, using the previously provided request ID.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Overview",
      "Anchor": "overview",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "Text": "The latest API version is 202604. Use this version in the LinkedIn-Version header for all API requests to access the most recent features and improvements.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "For new ATS partners",
      "Anchor": "for-new-ats-partners",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step - 1 Webhook CallBack URL Registration",
        "For new ATS partners"
      ],
      "Text": "Similar to the One Click Export (1CE) feature, the Application Evaluation Export functionality requires a webhook callback URL to be configured for each customer supported by the ATS platform. For application evaluation exports, this URL should be a valid webhook URL, which differs slightly from the URL used for One Click Export.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "For new ATS partners",
      "Anchor": "for-new-ats-partners",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step - 1 Webhook CallBack URL Registration",
        "For new ATS partners"
      ],
      "Text": "A customer-specific webhook must be allocated and configured during the widget-based customer onboarding process. This is done by syncing the integration configuration, as detailed in the referenced Postman collection.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "For existing ATS partners",
      "Anchor": "for-existing-ats-partners",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step - 1 Webhook CallBack URL Registration",
        "For existing ATS partners"
      ],
      "Text": "The ATS partners with existing customers onboarded to the RSC integration who want to enable the Application Evaluation Export feature for these customers, a webhook callback URL must be registered for each customer to receive webhook notifications.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "For existing ATS partners",
      "Anchor": "for-existing-ats-partners",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step - 1 Webhook CallBack URL Registration",
        "For existing ATS partners"
      ],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "For existing ATS partners",
      "Anchor": "for-existing-ats-partners",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step - 1 Webhook CallBack URL Registration",
        "For existing ATS partners"
      ],
      "Text": "Application Evaluation webhook callback URL needs to be configured for every customer.\nSame webhook URL can be configured for multiple customers.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "For existing ATS partners",
      "Anchor": "for-existing-ats-partners",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step - 1 Webhook CallBack URL Registration",
        "For existing ATS partners"
      ],
      "Text": "This process is explained here.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step - 2 Receive PUSH Notification",
      "Anchor": "step---2-receive-push-notification",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step - 2 Receive PUSH Notification"
      ],
      "Text": "LinkedIn evaluates applications for your job postings and sends request IDs to the registered webhook URLs. This process is explained here.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step - 3 Receive Exported Application Evaluation",
      "Anchor": "step---3-receive-exported-application-evaluation",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step - 3 Receive Exported Application Evaluation"
      ],
      "Text": "After receiving the application-evaluation-id, the ATS partner must fetch the detailed evaluation by making the appropriate API call. This process is explained here.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    }
  ]
